// CBOR - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# CBOR of {"greeting": "Hello World!"}.
# Major type 5 (a map) of one pair is 0xA1; major type 3 (text) of length
# 12 is 0x6C, because 12 is below the 24 that needs an extra byte.
0000  A1 68 67 72 65 65 74 69 6E 67 6C 48 65 6C 6C 6F |.hgreetinglHello|
0010  20 57 6F 72 6C 64 21                            | World!|
